cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WindPower_DigitalTwin"
message: "If you use this repository in academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Alexopoulos"
    given-names: "Dionysis"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Dionysis33/WindPower_DigitalTwin"
license: "AGPL-3.0"
abstract: >
  Research repository for spatio-temporal wind power forecasting on the DaKS / Kassel dataset,
  with emphasis on reproducible preprocessing, graph-ready feature engineering, strong tabular baselines,
  leakage-aware evaluation, and future extension toward prognostics-aware digital twin experimentation.

keywords:
  - wind power forecasting
  - digital twin
  - prognostics
  - health management
  - spatio-temporal modeling
  - baseline models
  - leakage-aware evaluation
  - DaKS dataset